=======
LEGEND
=======

. = Dark
# = Wall
P = Player and Light
S = ShadowEast and Dark
W = ShadowWest and Dark
Shade = ShadowEast or ShadowWest
K = Rune and Dark
G = GateClosed and Dark
Barrier = Wall or Light or GateClosed

